  "title": "Member Spotlight: Kitana's Natural Hair Journey",
  "summary": "I remember using too much product trying to get rid of my dry and damaged ends/hair. I ended up weighing down my hair, making it worse. Days, months, and years passed, and my hair continued to break off, look really thin, and uneven. I never wanted to deal with it so I always went to salons to get it done because I felt like they would know more about how to handle my hair than I did at the time.",
